<title>USA: Magellan Technology forms subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Magellan Technology forms subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>DRAPER, Utah 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magellan Technology Inc said it has formed Magellan Service Co, a wholly owned subsidiary that will specialize in contractual support of Department of Defense avaiation, logistics and maintenance operations.</p>
<p>The company said it had named Irving Monclova, a retired U.S. army colonel who served in Vietnam, as president and chief operating officer of the subsidiary.</p>
